+# highest run and image-automation-controller writes the resulting tag into
+# platform/nodesoftware-operator/deployment.yaml (initContainer
+# runsc-handler-mirror, image: ghcr.io/chidionyema/runsc). The controller's source
+# reads that initContainer's image at startup (cmd/main.go:resolveHandlerImage) and
+# uses it as the InstallImage for the handler pods it schedules. Without this row
+# the controller's --handler-image never tracks a published tag and every handler
+# pod ImagePulls the broken ":IMAGE_TAG" literal it shipped with.
